<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Australia May private credit rises 1.0 pct.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Australia May private credit rises 1.0 pct.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1997-07-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Reserve Bank of Australia (RBA) said private sector credit extended by financial intermediaries rose by 1.0 percent in May, seasonally-adjusted, after rising 1.0 percent in April</p>
<p>For the year to May, credit rose by 10.1 percent.</p>
</text>
